  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 518.09 Records and Reporting. Each provider agency shall:\n\n(a) Maintain records and provide documentation as outlined in He-M 504.03 and He-M 504.04 and He-M 517.10 for all individuals receiving services pursuant to He-M 518.05 and He-M 518.07; and\n\n(b) At least annually, assess the employment service through interviews with employers, individuals, and guardians.\n\nSource. #4593, eff 4-1-89; EXPIRED: 4-1-95\n\nNew. #6569, eff 8-22-97; ss and moved by #8406, eff8-22-05 (from He-M 518.11) ); ss by #10397, INTERIM, eff 8-22-13, EXPIRES: 2-18-14; ss by #10493, eff 2-18-14 (from He-M 518.07); ss by #14040, eff 8-1-24",
